\par Food is such an important necessity to focus our efforts on because food is related to so many aspects of the degradation of the earth.\u8198\'20 \u8198\'20 Food packaging represents 20% of all the single use plastics produced.\u8198\'20 \u8198\'20
 We face health issues related to the industrial way we have been growing food.\u8198\'20 \u8198\'20 Industrial farming practices make up 10% of CO2 emissions and lose of much of our underground water resources.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid7359610 
